stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> NOT_DUE
  NOT_DUE --> DUE : interval passed, new data expected, or last attempt failed
  DUE --> FETCH
  FETCH --> VALIDATE : answer received
  FETCH --> FAILURE : timeout or HTTP error
  VALIDATE --> ACCEPT : checks passed
  VALIDATE --> FAILURE : schema, range or date check failed
  ACCEPT --> HEALTHY : current file replaced or unchanged
  FAILURE --> DEGRADED : last valid data within its age limit
  FAILURE --> STALE : last valid data beyond its age limit
  HEALTHY --> [*]
  DEGRADED --> [*]
  STALE --> [*]
